msgid ""
"<a href='whatsthis:<em>Advanced Tag Features (ATF)</em>"
"<p>This is an optional but recommended set of features that use a unique "
"identifier stored in the metadata of your files to allow Amarok to track your "
"files in useful ways."
"<p>With ATF on, for instance, when you move or rename files within your "
"collection folders, the Playlist will keep the URL of the file current, so that "
"you do not need to remove and re-add the file.  Statistics information will not "
"be lost due to file renames or moves, either."
"<p>This feature is not turned on by default since it does require making (safe "
"and transparent) physical metadata additions to your files, but its use is "
"encouraged."
"<p><em>Turning on this feature requires a full collection rescan and clearing "
"your current playlist.  These actions will be performed when you next start "
"Amarok.</em>'>Information</a>"
